      "text": "A kitchen peninsula installation may require permits when the work changes electrical, plumbing, structural, or other regulated building elements, while a cosmetic cabinet and countertop update may have a different review path. In San Diego County, the exact requirements depend on the city, property, scope, historic status, and whether new circuits, fixtures, or structural changes are involved.",
